refused: d174_lend_mut_on_a_read_borrow.cy:11:54, line 11 column 54
11 |     let $n: Lend.mut from $r reading set_to Lend.mut $v;
   |                                                      ^^
 what: `$v` only reads what it borrows, so it can't lend it with `Lend.mut`
 why:  a stored `Lend` can be lent on with `Lend` only (D174, D2)
